# Cloudflare Pages headers (ADR-0008). Copied verbatim from public/ into the
# build root, where Cloudflare serves it. These headers make the deployed site
# cross-origin isolated, which is what backs `SharedArrayBuffer` and therefore
# the Slice 7 WASM thread pool (ADR-0007).
#
# This file is load-bearing for the Slice 8 service worker: Workbox precaches
# the *full network response* (headers included) at install time, so as long as
# every network response carries COOP/COEP, the SW-served cached index.html and
# .wasm stay cross-origin isolated offline. Drop these headers and the SW would
# serve a document without isolation → no SharedArrayBuffer → the render worker
# throws at boot → multicore silently off. The pwa-config guard test fails if
# COOP/COEP ever go missing here.
#
# Every asset is same-origin (self-hosted since Slice 0, watch-list #1), so
# COEP: require-corp has no cross-origin subresource to reject; CORP is added
# belt-and-braces.
# Strict Content-Security-Policy + hardening headers. The app is fully
# same-origin (self-hosted since Slice 0), so the policy is tight where it
# matters: `script-src` admits only same-origin scripts plus the
# `'wasm-unsafe-eval'` the WebAssembly compiler requires — no `'unsafe-inline'`
# script vector. `worker-src 'self'` admits the ES-module render worker and the
# rayon thread workers. `img-src ... data:` covers the data-URI manifest icons.
# `base-uri 'none'` and `frame-ancestors 'none'` block base-tag injection and
# clickjacking.
#
# `style-src` keeps `'unsafe-inline'` because the entire UI stylesheet is an
# inline `<style>` block in index.html (the framework-free, inline-CSS design of
# ADR-0003; `--accent` is also rewritten at runtime). A strict `style-src 'self'`
# would block it and ship an unstyled page. CSS injection is a far weaker vector
# than script injection, which stays locked down. `font-src ... data:` admits the
# self-hosted @fontsource webfonts, which Vite inlines as `data:` URIs. The
# pwa-config guard test asserts this CSP survives here.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; worker-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; connect-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
